<title>FRANCE: Peugeot has no comment on Brazil plant.</title>
<headline>Peugeot has no comment on Brazil plant.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>French carmaker Peugeot said on Monday it had no immediate comment on a newspaper report that it had indefinitely postponed plans to set up a car plant in Brazil.</p>
<p>Jornal do Brasil newspaper said on Monday that Peugeot had not given a reason for the move.</p>
<p>The newspaper said that Peugeot had planned to invest $600 million to produce 70,000 cars annually.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452 pmc</p>
